cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this S95 research snapshot, cite this release and the parent
  TCCT project. The parent Zenodo DOI below archives version v9.2.0 and
  predates this S95 snapshot; replace it with the S95 version DOI after a
  new Zenodo release is published.
type: software
title: "TCCT: S95 Strict Blind Research Release"
version: "S95-2026-08-12"
date-released: 2026-08-12
authors:
