license: AGPL-3.0
keywords:
  - "symbolic graph reasoning"
  - "counterfactual reasoning"
  - "graph rewriting"
  - "compositional generalization"
  - "blind evaluation"
  - "Wolfram Language"
abstract: >-
  A hash-locked experimental release of the TCCT symbolic graph-reasoning
  branch. It contains the S71-S95 research history, frozen artifacts,
  precommit records, checkpoints, result certificates, and the S95 strict
  blind evaluation. The release is a specialized research prototype and is
  not a general-purpose AI foundation model.
